  "description": "Meet Kevin, officially the GXR4, unofficially the bike that started as an inside joke about bike-naming conventions and never stopped being called by its nickname. One of the first gravel-specific bikes to market, the GXR has been refined generation after generation, and this latest version brings wider tyre clearance, improved mounting options and full UDH compatibility to Curve's original gravel platform.\nKevin has been tested the hard way, across South America, New Zealand, Switzerland, and plenty of terrain in between. Earning its reputation as the \"Swiss Army Knife\" of Curve's range. Rear rack mounts, fender mounts, triple bidon mounts and top-tube bento mounts mean it's equally at home on a fast gravel loop or a fully loaded multi-day tour.\nComplete and ready to ride, Kevin is the bike for riders who want one machine that does almost everything well.",
